"""Math Sprint development-build policy and support; no purchase offer."""
def build(page):
 page('/math-sprint-castle/privacy/', 'Math Sprint Castle privacy policy', 'Local progress, offline play, practice previews and support information for the Math Sprint Castle development build.', """<section><h1>Math Sprint Castle privacy policy</h1><p>Effective October 31, 2026. Developer: TripperDeeLabs. This describes the current development build.</p><h2>Offline game and local progress</h2><p>The game runs offline and does not require an account. The current Android build has no internet permission and no advertising, analytics or tracking SDK. Math progress, play time, coins, unlocked content, character selection and preferences are stored locally. Clearing app data or uninstalling can erase progress; the game does not provide an online backup account.</p><h2>Computer practice preview</h2><p>The watchable computer mode simulates play locally. Its preview time, coins and math answers do not change the player's saved progression. It does not send play data to TripperDeeLabs.</p><h2>Purchases</h2><p>The current development build does not process real-money purchases. Its All Access option is a preview. This policy will be updated before changes to payment or data handling are released.</p><h2>Children and support</h2><p>The game has no chat, public profiles or personal-information form, and does not request camera, microphone, contacts or location access. A parent or guardian can contact <a href="mailto:TripperDeeLabs@gmail.com">TripperDeeLabs@gmail.com</a> for support. Emails contain whatever address, message and attachments the sender chooses to provide; please do not include sensitive information about a child. Support correspondence is used to respond to the request and is not sold. Contact the same address to request its deletion.</p><h2>This website</h2><p>This app policy is separate from the <a href="/privacy/">website privacy policy</a>, which describes this site's optional analytics.</p><p><a href="/math-sprint-castle/">Game overview</a> · <a href="/math-sprint-castle/support/">Game support</a></p></section>""")
 page('/math-sprint-castle/support/', 'Math Sprint Castle support', 'Math Sprint Castle controls, computer preview, progress and feedback.', """<section><h1>Math Sprint Castle support</h1><p>Math Sprint Castle is in development for Android.</p><h2>Play the course</h2><p>Swipe left or right to change lanes, up to jump and down to duck. Knights and bridge gaps can end the run; unused running time is saved. Solve math separately to earn more time after the daily allowance is used.</p><h2>Watch computer</h2><p>Choose Watch computer on Home. Pause or restart the preview, tap its course label to preview another difficulty, or choose Show math to see a question and explanation. Home leaves the preview. Personal coins, unlocks and play time stay unchanged.</p><h2>Keep your progress</h2><p>Avoid clearing app data or uninstalling while troubleshooting. Progress is saved on the device, with no game-operated cloud account.</p><h2>Send feedback</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:TripperDeeLabs@gmail.com?subject=Math%20Sprint%20Castle%20feedback">TripperDeeLabs@gmail.com</a>. Include the game version, device model and what happened. A screenshot can help; do not include private information about a child.</p><p><a href="/math-sprint-castle/">Game overview</a> · <a href="/math-sprint-castle/privacy/">App privacy</a></p></section>""")
